abstract: >-
  SKILL.md files that give AI coding agents tested protocols for cancer
  bioinformatics, covering bulk multi-omics, immune deconvolution, survival
  analysis, single-cell atlases, spatial transcriptomics, and single-cell
  foundation models. Each skill is validated against public datasets.
